      "title": "Asking prices: 多少钱？",
      "body": "To ask how much something costs, say the thing and then add 多少钱 (literally 'how much money'). You can point with 这个 (this one) or 那个 (that one), or name the item. You don't need 是 or any other verb. You'll learn how to say the price in the answer in a moment.",
